{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-daily-conversation-hobbies-and-related-everyday-talk-write-like-you-are/audio/main-7dccea5fe486.mp3","durationSec":260.352,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.84,"text":"Small talk is short, polite talk."},{"start":2.26,"end":5.2,"text":"You use it with a neighbor, a coworker, or a person at the bus stop."},{"start":5.78,"end":7.06,"text":"The talk is light and friendly."},{"start":7.6,"end":8.56,"text":"It does not go deep."},{"start":9.56,"end":13.92,"text":"Safe topics are the weather, weekend plans, hobbies, food, and sports."},{"start":14.84,"end":21.22,"text":"In daily conversation, hobbies are a safe shared topic, because most people like to talk about the things they enjoy."},{"start":22.26,"end":28.2,"text":"People also use related everyday talk about the weather, food, and sports to keep the chat going."},{"start":28.94,"end":34.42,"text":"This kind of talk is the same in many countries, but the favorite hobby changes from place to place."},{"start":36.24,"end":38.2,"text":"The next parts show some real examples."},{"start":39.34,"end":41.4,"text":"Karaoke is a very common hobby in Japan."},{"start":42.36,"end":44.4,"text":"Karaoke means singing with a recorded band."},{"start":45.12,"end":48.14,"text":"The words show on a screen, so you can follow them as you sing."},{"start":49.54,"end":56.9,"text":"In 1971, a man named Daisuke Inoue built eight coin machines in the city of Kobe."},{"start":56.9,"end":61.06,"text":"They cost 100 yen for one song and used 8-track tapes."},{"start":61.06,"end":65.5,"text":"Today, friends in Japan often rent a karaoke box by the hour."},{"start":65.5,"end":69.8,"text":"A karaoke box is a small private room with a screen and microphones."},{"start":70.76,"end":72.2,"text":"Some people also go alone."},{"start":73.04,"end":74.68,"text":"Singing alone is called hitokara."},{"start":75.36,"end":81.52,"text":"On Monday, coworkers may ask about the weekend, and \"I went to karaoke\" is an easy and friendly answer."},{"start":82.26,"end":85.52,"text":"Another easy weekend topic in Japan is a trip to an onsen."},{"start":85.96,"end":88.28,"text":"An onsen is a Japanese hot spring."},{"start":89.1,"end":94.42,"text":"Japan has about 25,000 hot spring sources and about 3,000 onsen places."},{"start":95.28,"end":98.52,"text":"Dogo Onsen in the city of Matsuyama is one of the oldest."},{"start":99.22,"end":104.22,"text":"There are simple rules: you wash first, and you do not wear a swimsuit in this kind of onsen."},{"start":105.28,"end":106.78,"text":"Some talk changes with the season."},{"start":107.34,"end":110.54,"text":"In late March and early April, people talk about cherry trees."},{"start":111.22,"end":113.3,"text":"Hanami is a picnic under cherry trees."},{"start":113.3,"end":119.28,"text":"Ueno Park in Tokyo has over 1,000 cherry trees, so it is a popular place for hanami."},{"start":120.16,"end":123.74,"text":"Weather talk and hanami talk often mix at this time of year."},{"start":124.88,"end":130.26,"text":"In Germany, Monday talk is often about football, and very often about FC Bayern Munich."},{"start":130.88,"end":133.9,"text":"The top league, the Bundesliga, began in 1963."},{"start":135,"end":139.58,"text":"FC Bayern Munich play at the Allianz Arena and have 31 Bundesliga titles."},{"start":140.72,"end":142.36,"text":"Football is not only for watching."},{"start":142.36,"end":152.1,"text":"The German football association, the DFB, has about 6.6 million members, about 8 percent of the country, and over 31,000 clubs."},{"start":153.18,"end":154.94,"text":"Not all weekend talk is about a match."},{"start":155.64,"end":163.2,"text":"In Munich, people also talk about a Sunday walk in the Englischer Garten, a big park in the city."},{"start":164.58,"end":165.74,"text":"Cycling is common too."},{"start":166.32,"end":170.02,"text":"About 42 percent of adults cycled at least once in 2020."},{"start":170.02,"end":173.72,"text":"In Spain, cafe talk often follows El Clasico."},{"start":174.52,"end":178.22,"text":"El Clasico is the match between FC Barcelona and Real Madrid."},{"start":179.02,"end":184.24,"text":"The two teams first met on 13 May 1902, and Barcelona won 3-1."},{"start":184.24,"end":190.6,"text":"As of 10 May 2026, the two teams were tied at 106 wins each, with 52 draws."},{"start":191.64,"end":194.18,"text":"Lionel Messi scored 26 goals in these matches."},{"start":197.93,"end":200.87,"text":"In Switzerland, hiking is the big weekend hobby."},{"start":201.47,"end":206.65,"text":"The country has more than 65,000 kilometers of marked trails, many through the Alps."},{"start":207.51,"end":211.79,"text":"About 50,000 yellow Wanderweg signs show the walking time to the next place."},{"start":212.49,"end":220.03,"text":"About 2.7 million people, around 44 percent, hike often, so \"Where did you walk this weekend\" is a normal Monday question."},{"start":220.81,"end":225.47,"text":"In the United States, sports talk is often about the NFL, the American football league."},{"start":225.83,"end":227.69,"text":"The NFL has 32 teams."},{"start":228.11,"end":234.35,"text":"The Super Bowl is the last NFL game of the season and one of the top TV sports events in the country."},{"start":234.35,"end":238.11,"text":"Remember, this sport is American football, not soccer."},{"start":238.11,"end":241.25,"text":"Family time and sports talk meet at Thanksgiving."},{"start":242.09,"end":244.55,"text":"Thanksgiving is the fourth Thursday of November."},{"start":245.19,"end":247.69,"text":"A federal law fixed this date in 1941."},{"start":248.99,"end":252.77,"text":"Families eat a big meal together, and many watch NFL games that weekend."},{"start":253.27,"end":259.93,"text":"So the small talk at the table mixes food talk and sports talk, two safe topics from Part 1."}],"words":[{"text":"Small","start":0,"end":0.32},{"text":"talk","start":0.32,"end":0.56},{"text":"is","start":